Upstream revision
-----------------

The upstream project records the monorepo commit it was synced from in a root
`SOURCE_REV` file. This fork does not currently record its fork point, so the
precise upstream revision these sources correspond to is not stated here and
cannot be inferred from this repository. Whoever performed the fork should add a
`SOURCE_REV` file at this repository root containing that commit SHA, so that
this fork can be diffed against upstream and so that the provenance of
inherited code is verifiable. This value has deliberately not been guessed.
